ian Schneller","role":"Mr. Eddelbüttel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a1AAugkNEaHVLngDT9zHNFtdXWq.jpg"},{"id":586674,"name":"Butz Ulrich Buse","role":"Catholic Priest","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bLIrSOzpSERMqNruxbJXdISmOQq.jpg"},{"id":1303308,"name":"Ivica Zadro","role":"The Other Josip","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bYpZnlJsdBkDbOp6LxJXFixWTlA.jpg"},{"id":4374187,"name":"Zvonimir Kovačić","role":"Klapa Singer"},{"id":4374359,"name":"Mirko Stanić","role":"Klapa Singer"},{"id":4374360,"name":"Ivan Žanić","role":"Klapa Singer"},{"id":4374371,"name":"Ante Blažević","role":"Klapa Singer"},{"id":4374443,"name":"Alen Babić","role":"Klapa Singer"},{"id":4374446,"name":"Andrijana Gardun","role":"Car Mechanic"},{"id":4374454,"name":"Hans-Joachim Bauer","role":"Mourner"},{"id":1263535,"name":"Adnan Erten","role":"Mourner"},{"id":4374458,"name":"Lola Stellmann","role":"Mourner"},{"id":1898025,"name":"Antonio Franić","role":"Ferry Guard","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/53RXIBGwcANYEKC2HkFSxi34Lj8.jpg"},{"id":4374472,"name":"Krešimir Glavina","role":"Bus Driver"},{"id":4374480,"name":"Miodrag Tarašić","role":"Grandfather in Bus"},{"id":4374485,"name":"Toma Frlan","role":"Little Child in Bus"},{"id":4374493,"name":"Katja Tramontana Domaćina","role":"Woman in Restaurant"},{"id":4374501,"name":"Joško Domaćina","role":"Man in Restaurant"},{"id":4374502,"name":"Zora Sapunar","role":"Old Woman"},{"id":4374511,"name":"Joško Dujmović","role":"Farm Worker"},{"id":4374521,"name":"Dušica Novaković","role":"Market Woman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8tLhb1G6UAO7lEDk8RVjz36Sk2Q.jpg"},{"id":4374532,"name":"Ana Cecić Vidoš","role":"Market Woman"},{"id":46992,"name":"Adriana Altaras","role":"Kata (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/LZybMQQCzFDdqKJKkPhQYP6U1X.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Un'isola per cambiare","overview":"Dopo aver ereditato una casa su un'isola croata, una donna intraprende un viaggio improvviso che le riaccende la gioia di vivere e apre le porte a un nuovo amore."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Zeynap Altin is at the end of her tether: she works far too much and is not valued at all by her husband, daughter and father. To make matters worse, the funeral home dressed her beloved late mother in a man's suit instead of her favorite dress. Enough is enough: Zeynep flees from Munich to the previously unknown holiday home on a Croatian island that her mother secretly bought years ago - with the hope of finding quiet, peace and herself there. If only the previous owner Josip, a rough islander, didn't still live on the same property and annoy her with his views and wisdom."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Zeynap Altin ist am Ende ihrer Kräfte: Sie arbeitet viel zu viel und wird von Ehemann, Tochter und Vater überhaupt nicht wertgeschätzt. Zu allem Überfluss hat das Bestattungsunternehmen ihre geliebte verstorbene Mutter in einen Herrenanzug anstatt in ihr Lieblingskleid gesteckt. Genug ist genug: Zeynep flüchtet aus München in das ihr bis dato unbekannte Ferienhaus auf einer kroatischen Insel, das ihre Mutter vor Jahren heimlich gekauft hat - mit der Hoffnung, dort Ruhe, Frieden und zu sich selbst zu finden. Wenn nur der frühere Besitzer Josip, ein rauer Inselbewohner, nicht immer noch auf demselben Grundstück leben und sie mit seinen Ansichten und Lebensweisheiten nerven würde.","tagline":"Manchmal brauchen wir alle einen Neuanfang."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/10YDrJvHrQw5s9a7dm9SzQxiTs5.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pUptUgPYwdNVSzMNRcUUs7WZ2Ap.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1081291,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poste